# Response templates for installation-instruction conversion (issue #918).
#
# The headings, the conversion algorithm and the step labels rendered for every
# target surface (README, Bash, PowerShell) from one install-step list. Moved out
# of data/seed/multilingual-responses-synthesis.lino by category so each response
# file stays within 1500 lines. Placeholders in braces are filled by the handler.

multilingual_responses
  response response_installation_conversion_heading_en
    intent installation_conversion_heading
    language en
    text "Converted installation instructions for {project}."
  response response_installation_conversion_heading_ru
    intent installation_conversion_heading
    language ru
    text "Преобразованные инструкции по установке для {project}."
  response response_installation_conversion_heading_hi
    intent installation_conversion_heading
    language hi
    text "{project} के लिए रूपांतरित installation निर्देश।"
  response response_installation_conversion_heading_zh
    intent installation_conversion_heading
    language zh
    text "已转换的 {project} 安装说明。"
  response response_installation_conversion_heading_es
    intent installation_conversion_heading
    language es
    text "Instrucciones de instalación convertidas para {project}."
  response response_installation_formalized_meaning_heading_en
    intent installation_formalized_meaning_heading
    language en
    text "Formalized meaning:"
  response response_installation_formalized_meaning_heading_ru
    intent installation_formalized_meaning_heading
    language ru
    text "Формализованный смысл:"
  response response_installation_formalized_meaning_heading_hi
    intent installation_formalized_meaning_heading
    language hi
    text "औपचारिक अर्थ:"
  response response_installation_formalized_meaning_heading_zh
    intent installation_formalized_meaning_heading
    language zh
    text "形式化含义："
  response response_installation_formalized_meaning_heading_es
    intent installation_formalized_meaning_heading
    language es
    text "Significado formalizado:"
  response response_installation_conversion_algorithm_en
    intent installation_conversion_algorithm
    language en
    text "Conversion algorithm:\n1. Detect the source surface and requested target surface(s).\n2. Extract command-like install/deploy steps in original order.\n3. Render every target from the same install-step IR.\n4. Preserve commands verbatim so the conversion can round-trip."
  response response_installation_conversion_algorithm_ru
    intent installation_conversion_algorithm
    language ru
    text "Алгоритм преобразования:\n1. Определить исходную поверхность и запрошенные целевые поверхности.\n2. Извлечь шаги установки/развёртывания, похожие на команды, в исходном порядке.\n3. Отрисовать каждую цель из одного и того же промежуточного представления шагов установки.\n4. Сохранять команды дословно, чтобы преобразование было обратимым."
  response response_installation_conversion_algorithm_hi
    intent installation_conversion_algorithm
    language hi
    text "रूपांतरण algorithm:\n1. स्रोत surface और अनुरोधित target surface(s) पहचानें।\n2. Command जैसे install/deploy steps को मूल क्रम में निकालें।\n3. हर target को उसी install-step IR से render करें।\n4. Commands को ज्यों का त्यों रखें ताकि रूपांतरण round-trip हो सके।"
  response response_installation_conversion_algorithm_zh
    intent installation_conversion_algorithm
    language zh
    text "转换算法：\n1. 识别源表面和请求的目标表面。\n2. 按原有顺序提取类似命令的安装/部署步骤。\n3. 从同一个安装步骤中间表示渲染每个目标。\n4. 逐字保留命令，使转换可以往返。"
  response response_installation_conversion_algorithm_es
    intent installation_conversion_algorithm
    language es
    text "Algoritmo de conversión:\n1. Detectar la superficie de origen y las superficies de destino solicitadas.\n2. Extraer los pasos de instalación o despliegue con forma de comando en su orden original.\n3. Generar cada destino a partir de la misma representación intermedia de pasos de instalación.\n4. Conservar los comandos literalmente para que la conversión pueda hacer el viaje de ida y vuelta."
  response response_installation_markdown_heading_en
    intent installation_markdown_heading
    language en
    text "README.md installation guide:\n\n## Installation"
  response response_installation_markdown_heading_ru
    intent installation_markdown_heading
